// Title: Proxy Execution via Vshadow
// Rule ID: d7c75059-2901-4578-b209-8837fd31c6a8
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1202
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_vshadow_exec.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
